SOLUTION 1 River Water
    pH      6.0
    Cl      10
    units   mg/l
    Na      1 charge
SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    pH      8.1
    Cl      19000
    units   mg/l
    Na      1 charge
MIX 1
    1       0.7
    2       0.3
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    FIX_PH 6.63  HCl  -10
    # This is a trick to fix pH in PHREEQC, but I'll just use a simpler way.
END
